@startuml C1_Generate_Operation_Plans_Logical_View
title C1 - Generate Operation Plans (Context View)

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam cloud {
  BackgroundColor LightGray
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor CornflowerBlue
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor White
}

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator

cloud "Identity Provider\n(OAuth 2.0 / OIDC)" as IAM
cloud "OEM Operation Planning API\n(NestJS)" as OEM
cloud "VVN Catalog API\n(TodoApi)" as VVN
cloud "Resource Catalog APIs\n(Resources, Staff, Storage)" as Resources
rectangle "Port Logistics Management System (PLMS)" as PLMS {
  rectangle "Angular SPA\n(Operation Plans UI)" as SPA
}

Operator --> SPA : Browser (HTTPS)
Operator --> IAM : Login / SSO
SPA --> OEM : REST JSON (with credentials)
OEM --> IAM : Validate identity / roles
OEM --> VVN : Fetch approved VVNs for day
OEM --> Resources : Fetch cranes, staff, storage
OEM --> SPA : Plans + metadata

@enduml
